### Create review for a completed booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 3,
  "rating": 5,
  "communicationRating": 5,
  "reliabilityRating": 5,
  "careRating": 5,
  "comment": "Sehr liebevolle Betreuung mit guten Updates."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("reviewId", response.body.data.id);
%}
